From ea78f81b181f5773399f3a4c0143070de8ff2d21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 10:19:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild composer on the shared QuickPublishPanel engine
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Extends the Studio's QuickPublishPanel (additively — existing usage
unchanged) with the safety layer it was missing:
- pre-publish checklist from the shared social-limits helpers (X thread /
  LinkedIn comment-overflow / Threads chain counts shown BEFORE the click)
- Instagram gating when the item has no image (disabled checkbox + hint
  instead of a publish-time error; excluded from 'publish to all')
- optional beforeAction hook and remembered platform selection

New ComposerSheet wraps that same engine for the Library: media preview +
inline caption editing (persisted before the first platform posts), opened
from a single 'Publish / Schedule' action on every card — no more five
separate per-platform dialogs in the golden path. Studio's panel now also
receives caption/hasImage, so both surfaces share one publisher and one
validation story.

Frontend-only; no API, schema, or contract changes.
Tests: 7 composer tests; studio + library suites green (65 total).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EJdoZ8bk1pWTrmbMVQJZ7G
